WEBVTT

00:24:28.708 --> 00:24:31.476
Because a breach of trust
says to the other person

00:24:31.500 --> 00:24:34.184
not just that they've lost power,
but they've lost value.

00:24:34.208 --> 00:24:35.476
You don't matter.

00:24:35.500 --> 00:24:37.684
Therefore, I put my interests
ahead of yours,

00:24:37.708 --> 00:24:39.393
I do the thing that suits me.

00:24:39.417 --> 00:24:43.101
It basically is a message
of devaluation of the other person.

00:24:43.125 --> 00:24:46.559
So that benevolent thing
that you talk about is crucial.

00:24:46.583 --> 00:24:49.143
I would say the thing I like to add is

00:24:49.167 --> 00:24:51.601
the need to create new experiences.

00:24:51.625 --> 00:24:54.809
You know, what happens
when people have been shaken

00:24:54.833 --> 00:24:57.934
is that they don't go back
to the state of naivety

00:24:57.958 --> 00:24:59.226
that they had before,

00:24:59.250 --> 00:25:01.476
that leap of faith in which they existed,